  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "text": "I embarked on this path... "
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "text": "And ended up winning the National"
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "text": "Student Assassin championship."
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "text": "I really did my best! But you know,"
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "text": "in hindsight it was a cinch."
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "text": "I guess I'm just blessed..."
  },
  {
